ator plants, and leave the site as you found it.","short_summary":"A bench-lined garden beside the Native Plant Garden.","evidence_claim":"The Butterfly Garden is off Copeland Creek Trail, bordered by the Native Plant Garden and Lot G, with benches and nectar-rich plants that attract pollinators.","source_url":"https://sustainablessu.sonoma.edu/ssu-nature-connections/nature-connection-sites","source_title":"Nature Connection Sites | Sustainable SSU","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Outdoor setting; use the described trail access and respect plants and wildlife.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"ssu-university-art-gallery","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"University Art Gallery","title":"See what is on at the University Art Gallery","subtitle":"Saturday afternoon · Art Building","notes":"Check the current exhibition listing before walking over, then give yourself time to view the displayed work and any accompanying gallery information.","short_summary":"A campus gallery for contemporary art exhibitions.","evidence_claim":"The University Art Gallery presents exhibitions and public programs, including work by modern and contemporary artists and Sonoma State faculty and students.","source_url":"https://artgallery.sonoma.edu/","source_title":"University Art Gallery","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The gallery lists Tuesday–Saturday, noon–4 p.m., during exhibitions only; confirm that an exhibition is open before visiting.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"ssu-green-music-center-weill-hall","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Green Music Center","title":"Choose a Green Music Center performance","subtitle":"Saturday night · Weill Hall and lawn","